This project is a TypeScript port of phpMyAdmin 5.2.3. It includes, or translates, the following third-party work:

- phpMyAdmin 5.2.3, by the phpMyAdmin contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later (https://www.phpmyadmin.net/). Its Twig templates, locales and PHP sources (kept for reference) are in vendor/phpmyadmin-5.2.3/, and its themes, JavaScript and documentation are in public/. These files are unmodified. Its license is in vendor/phpmyadmin-5.2.3/LICENSE. The TypeScript code translates phpMyAdmin's PHP classes.
- phpmyadmin/sql-parser and phpmyadmin/shapefile, by the phpMyAdmin contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later. src/sql-parser/ translates sql-parser, and src/lib/pma/export-import/shapefile.ts translates shapefile.
- phpmyadmin/twig-i18n-extension, Copyright (c) 2010-2019 Fabien Potencier and (c) 2019-2021 phpMyAdmin contributors, MIT. src/lib/twig/i18n.ts translates its {% trans %} handling.
- TCPDF 6.10, by Nicola Asuni, LGPL-3.0-or-later (https://tcpdf.org/). src/lib/pma/pdf/tcpdf.ts translates the parts of TCPDF that phpMyAdmin uses. Because of this, the project as a whole is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.
- DejaVu Sans font metrics in src/lib/pma/pdf/dejavu-widths.json, taken from TCPDF's dejavusans font files. The DejaVu fonts are under the Bitstream Vera Fonts license, and DejaVu's changes are in the public domain (https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html). No font outlines are included.
- zlib 1.3, Copyright (C) 1995-2023 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler, zlib license. src/lib/pma/export-import/zlib-deflate.ts is an altered translation of deflate.c and trees.c. The license is in that file's header.
- The JavaScript libraries in public/js/vendor/ (jQuery and its plugins, Bootstrap, CodeMirror, jqPlot, OpenLayers, js-cookie, sprintf.js, TraceKit, u2f-api-polyfill, zxcvbn-ts), as shipped with phpMyAdmin 5.2.3, keep their own licenses, stated in their file headers.

